       |
       |           PHI              VARIABLE c@2, VARIABLE c@1, VARIABLE c@3
     3 | LABEL_1:
     4 |           EQUAL            VARIABLE <temp_1>@1, CONSTANT s32 1, CONSTANT s32 1
