    12 |           JUMP             LABEL_6
    13 | LABEL_6:
    14 |           JUMP             LABEL_1
    15 | LABEL_3:
    16 |           JUMP             LABEL_4
    17 | LABEL_4:
    18 |           JUMP             LABEL_2
       |
       |           PHI              VARIABLE c@4, VARIABLE c@2, VARIABLE c@3
    19 | LABEL_2:
    20 |           RETURN
